  "steps": [
    {"text": "Heat the oil in the pot over medium heat. Cook the onion, carrot and celery until soft, {time 8 min}. Add the garlic, rosemary sprig and pepper flakes for {time 1 min}.", "uses": ["oil", "onion", "carrot", "celery", "garlic", "rosemary", "flakes"]},
    {"text": "Add the tomatoes, beans, broth and salt and simmer for {time 10 min}. Remove the rosemary stem and mash about a third of the beans against the pot to thicken the soup.", "uses": ["tomatoes", "beans", "broth", "salt"]},
    {"text": "Add the pasta and simmer, stirring often so it doesn’t stick, until tender, {time 10-12 min}. The soup should be thick; add a splash of water if it’s too stiff.", "uses": ["pasta"]},
    {"text": "Serve with the cheese and a drizzle of olive oil.", "uses": ["cheese"]}
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The pasta keeps soaking up liquid, so loosen leftovers with water or broth when reheating."
